title: The venture, in brief
description: Facts that hold regardless of where the playbook stands.
sections:
  - title: Who
    description: Two founders, one product.
    body: |
      Two of us, both technical. No employees until revenue covers one.
  - title: Money
    body: |
      Bootstrapped. A **business account** opens the day the company does.
    children:
      - title: Banking
        body: One account, one card, receipts photographed the same day.
      - title: Tax
        body: Quarterly, by the accountant. We keep the folder.
        content:
          kind: playbook
          doc:
            version: 2
            title: When a quarter ends
            decisions: []
            events:
              - key: quarter-ends
                label: The quarter ends
                trigger: imposed
                content: {kind: md, doc: The folder goes to the accountant; the return comes back signed within the month.}
